            <div xml:id="d260">

                <pb facs="0305" n="205" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg205"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.6363/667</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hanna</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-04-20"><hi rendition="#italic">April 20,
                        1920</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received April 29.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 3062</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to the Embassy’s telegram
                    No. 79, dated March 20, 4 P.M., summarizing a presidential decree authorizing
                    the granting of concessions for developing oil lands on Mexican national
                    territory, such as federal zones, banks and beds of rivers, streams, lakes and
                    lagoons, I have the honor to enclose, herewith, <pb facs="0306" n="206"
                        xml:id="pg206"/> copy of the decree in reference as published in <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Diario Official</hi> of March 19, 1920, together with a
                    translation of the same. It has not been practicable to furnish the Department
                    with this translation at an earlier date but a translation was forwarded to the
                    Department by the Consulate General in this city with its despatch No. 2010, of
                    March 24, 1920.<anchor n="38" xml:id="d260-f1"/></p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Matthew E. Hanna</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d260-a1.xml" xpointer="d260-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
